      "message": "Aside from the minor formatting issues, this also breaks serialization. There is a version number that\u0027s incremented in src/core/SkPicturePriv.h.\n\nBest practice is to add a new value to the enum. The writing code can blindly write the current version. The reading code should attempt to handle older serialized data, by checking the stream\u0027s version. An example of that logic, from the most recent version tick: https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/535437/3/src/core/SkReadBuffer.cpp",
